itchesAndWombats","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Wizards, Witches and Wombats In a strange and mystical land, Wizards, Witches and Wombats face off in a friendly competition to see which of them is the strengthiest.  They decide the competition will be a round-robin of head-to-head matches. Both contestants will simultaneously cast a spell \u2013 either a light spell or dark spell.  Scores will calculated as follows:  If both cast light spell: both get +15 points. If both cast dark spells: both get 0 points. Light spell vs dark spell: -5 for the one who cast light, +5 for the one who cast dark. This is a variant of the Prisoner\u2019s Dilemma I use in talks, #HourOfCode, etc about problem solving. Attendees either provide their strategy to me and I code it in real-time, or if they are coders they\u2019ll code it based off an abstract class they inherit.  ","topics":[],"score":2151,"global_rank":260387},{"name":"codefellows/seattle-102n42","owner":"codefellows","html_url":"https://github.com/codefellows/seattle-102n42","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"CSS","description":"Code 102 with Principal Instructor, Brian Nations","topics":[],"score":2151,"global_rank":260390},{"name":"asaikiranb/A4","owner":"asaikiranb","html_url":"https://github.com/asaikiranb/A4","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":null,"topics":[],"score":2151,"global_rank":260393},{"name":"burntcreamlatte/MovieSearchObjC","owner":"burntcreamlatte","html_url":"https://github.com/burntcreamlatte/MovieSearchObjC","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2151,"global_rank":260399},{"name":"solka2019/Responsive-Portfolio","owner":"solka2019","html_url":"https://github.com/solka2019/Responsive-Portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Homework assignment 02","topics":[],"score":2151,"global_rank":260405},{"name":"BrentCleary/Calculator","owner":"BrentCleary","h